  "description": "Retention and alteration of an existing freestanding timber pergola within the private rear garden/patio serving 74A Glentham Road, incorporating a reduction in its overall size and depth, together with a 17 mm green artificial grass finish over the waterproof roof surface.\n\nThe proposed alterations are intended to reduce the structure's visual bulk, improve openness and minimise its impact on neighbouring residential amenity and the character of the Castelnau Conservation Area.\n\nThe pergola will remain open-sided, entirely within the private demised garden, freestanding and independent of neighbouring structures, with no overhang onto adjoining land.",
